  "locationString": "Macquarie Park, Ryde, Greater Sydney, New South Wales",
  "description": "Quest Macquarie Park provides serviced apartment accommodation located just 12km north-west of Sydney’s CBD. Located in the heart of Macquarie Park, the Metro Station is within a few minutes walk. Quest Macquarie Park is near Macquarie University, Macquarie University Hospital and Macquarie Shopping Centre with easy access to Ryde, Chatswood, Epping and Lane Cove via Epping Road, Hills M2 Motorway, M4 and the M7. Quest Macquarie Park's serviced apartments include studios, and one and two bedroom apartments. Our serviced apartments are the perfect alternative to a hotel room with full kitchens and laundry facilities. The one and two bedroom apartments are ideal for families, colleagues or larger groups looking for a home away from home experience.",
